SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "CGC.gc_ldr_small_lot_secondary_frontage", "instrument_version": "CGC_CITY_PLAN@2026-09-29", "topic": "SETBACK.SECONDARY_ROAD", "title": "6.2.1.3 Table 6.2.1-1 RO1 (small lots); Table 6.2.1-2 AO1", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "BUILDING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTED_DEVELOPMENT_REQUIREMENT", "measurement": "SCHEME_SETBACK_SECONDARY_FRONTAGE", "operator": ">=", "value": 4, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "REFERRAL_TO_LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "effective_from": "2026-09-29", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "GOLD_COAST"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "CGC:LOW_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}], "subjects": ["CLASS_1"], "sources": [{"key": "gc_ldr_small_lot_secondary_frontage", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"secondary_frontage_setback_min\", \"operator\": \">=\", \"value\": 4, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [], \"exceptions\": [\"not including projections up to 2m\"], \"formula_text\": null}\nLot conditions (not encoded): small lot (< 400m2), corner lot\nStructure scope 'Dwelling house on small lot' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_1']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES\nResearcher notes: 'not including projections up to 2m' - ambiguous whether projections may extend 2m into the 4m setback. No secondary frontage rule in the standard (>=400m2) table. Table 1.5-1 (s1.5 Building work regulated under the City Plan) lists 'Alternatives to QDC boundary clearance provisions' -> 'Buildings: Relevant zone code ...' (Section 33(2) BA). Applies to buildings (incl. Class 1 and Class 10a buildings). For 'Structures' only the Coastal erosion hazard and Road widening overlay codes are alternatives; 'QDC setbacks will apply to any building or structure where an alternative setback is not provided in the above codes.' Scheme refers to QDC MP1.1/MP1.2, not the QHC."}$q$::jsonb);
