SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "CGC.gc_ldr_building_height", "instrument_version": "CGC_CITY_PLAN@2026-09-29", "topic": "HEIGHT.BUILDING", "title": "6.2.1.3 Table 6.2.1-1 RO3; Table 6.2.1-2 AO3.1", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "BUILDING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTED_DEVELOPMENT_REQUIREMENT", "measurement": "SCHEME_HEIGHT", "operator": "<=", "value": 9, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "REFERRAL_TO_LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "effective_from": "2026-09-29", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "GOLD_COAST"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "CGC:LOW_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}], "subjects": ["ANY"], "sources": [{"key": "gc_ldr_building_height", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"building_height_max\", \"operator\": \"<=\", \"value\": 9, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"2 storeys max (RO3)\", \"AO3.1 also allows a partial third storey if within 9m\"], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": null}\nStructure scope 'buildings' mapped by keyword to ['ANY'] (default)\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES\nResearcher notes: Table 1.5-1: 'Alternative to QDC building height provisions (performance criterion 4) | Relevant zone code | Section 32(b) BA and section 10(2)(b) BR'. Dwelling house overlay (Table 5.10.5) makes dwelling house exceeding Building height overlay height / partial third storey / 9m impact assessable."}$q$::jsonb);
