SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "CGC.gc_small_lot_garage_opening_width", "instrument_version": "CGC_CITY_PLAN@2026-09-29", "topic": "GARAGE.FRONTAGE", "title": "9.4.10.3 Table 9.4.10-1 RO1; Table 9.4.10-2 AO1", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "PLANNING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTED_DEVELOPMENT_REQUIREMENT", "measurement": "SCHEME_GARAGE_CARPORT", "operator": ">=", "value": {"op": "unencoded", "text": "Where the street frontage is 10m or less: - a single storey dwelling is limited to a single car width opening (3m maximum); or - a two storey dwelling can have a double car width opening (6m maximum).", "extracted_value": null, "extracted_operator": "conditional"}, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "PLANNING_APPROVAL_REQUIRED", "effective_from": "2026-09-29", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "GOLD_COAST"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "CGC:LOW_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "CGC:MEDIUM_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}], "subjects": ["CLASS_10A"], "sources": [{"key": "gc_small_lot_garage_opening_width", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"garage_opening_width_max\", \"operator\": \"conditional\", \"value\": null, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"frontage <= 10m\", \"single storey: 3m\", \"two storey: 6m\"], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": null}\nLot conditions (not encoded): small lot (< 400m2) with street frontage 10m or less\nStructure scope 'garage/carport opening (car parking)' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_10A']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: NO\nResearcher notes: Planning requirement for MCU of Dwelling house on small lot (accepted subject to requirements in LDR/MDR). Not listed in Table 1.5-1 as a QDC alternative (car parking alternative is the Transport code). Code applies to 'material change of use for development for a Dwelling house on a small lot'."}$q$::jsonb);
UPDATE rule_versions SET status = 'DRAFT' WHERE rule_version_id = $q$CGC.gc_small_lot_garage_opening_width@2026-09-29$q$;
SELECT define_provision($q$CGC_CITY_PLAN@2026-09-29$q$, $q$9.4.10.3 Table 9.4.10-1 RO14; Table 9.4.10-2 AO10$q$, 'ACCEPTED_DEVELOPMENT_REQUIREMENT', $q$Within the front 3m of the primary frontage, development provides garden beds, planted with native species, along any side and front boundary, excluding driveway area, with a minimum width of 1m. OR The development has an existing operational works approval for landscape works. Note: This RO excludes frontages to rear lanes.$q$, 'VERIFIED_VERBATIM', $q$ruleId 6079 / 6105$q$, NULL, $q$Small lot housing (infill focus) code (9.4.10)$q$, NULL, $q$https://cityplan.goldcoast.qld.gov.au/eplan/api/l/r/115/0/false/08-Sep-2026/false$q$, $q$Scheme definition 'Setback': shortest horizontal distance from the outermost projection of the building or structure to the vertical projection of the lot boundary. 'Outermost projection' excludes retractable blinds, fixed screens, rainwater fittings, ornamental attachments. Note: when acting as a QDC alternative provision, the building certifier may apply QDC/QHC measurement conventions (boundary clearance, also defined in Sch 1) - manual review.$q$, $q$gc_small_lot_landscaping_front$q$);
