SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "CGC.gc_rural_rear_setback", "instrument_version": "CGC_CITY_PLAN@2026-09-29", "topic": "SETBACK.REAR", "title": "6.2.20.3 Table 6.2.20-1 RO1; Table 6.2.20-2 PO1/AO1", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "BUILDING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTED_DEVELOPMENT_REQUIREMENT", "measurement": "SCHEME_SETBACK_REAR", "operator": ">=", "value": 6, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "REFERRAL_TO_LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "effective_from": "2026-09-29", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "GOLD_COAST"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "CGC:RURAL"}], "subjects": ["ANY"], "sources": [{"key": "gc_rural_rear_setback", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"rear_setback_min\", \"operator\": \">=\", \"value\": 6, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": null}\nStructure scope 'all buildings (no Class 10 / outbuilding distinction)' mapped by keyword to ['ANY']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES\nResearcher notes: Same 6m 'Side and rear' value. Table 1.5-1 (s1.5, ruleId 2203, text unchanged in v14) lists 'Alternatives to QDC boundary clearance provisions' -> 'Buildings: Relevant zone code ...' (Section 33(2) BA). Applies to buildings (incl. Class 1 and Class 10a buildings such as sheds, garages, carports). For 'Structures' only the Coastal erosion hazard and Road widening overlay codes are alternatives; 'QDC setbacks will apply to any building or structure where an alternative setback is not provided in the above codes.' Scheme refers to QDC MP1.1/MP1.2, not the QHC."}$q$::jsonb);
