e LDR 'Between on-site habitable buildings' separation row and without any small-lot / Class 10 built-to-boundary allowance. Whether 'Height' means overall building height or height of the relevant part is not stated (same issue as LDR). Subdivision-approval status needs a lookup. Table 1.5-1 (s1.5, ruleId 2203, text unchanged in v14) lists 'Alternatives to QDC boundary clearance provisions' -> 'Buildings: Relevant zone code ...' (Section 33(2) BA). Applies to buildings (incl. Class 1 and Class 10a buildings such as sheds, garages, carports). For 'Structures' only the Coastal erosion hazard and Road widening overlay codes are alternatives; 'QDC setbacks will apply to any building or structure where an alternative setback is not provided in the above codes.' Scheme refers to QDC MP1.1/MP1.2, not the QHC."}$q$::jsonb);
