SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "CGC.gc_hdr_side_rear_setback_height_tiered", "instrument_version": "CGC_CITY_PLAN@2026-09-29", "topic": "SETBACK.SIDE", "title": "6.2.3.3 Table 6.2.3-1 RO1; Table 6.2.3-2 AO1", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "BUILDING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTED_DEVELOPMENT_REQUIREMENT", "measurement": "SCHEME_SETBACK_SIDE", "operator": ">=", "value": {"op": "unencoded", "text": "h<=4.5 -> 1.5; 4.5<h<=7.5 -> 2.0; h>7.5 -> 2.0 + 0.5*ceil((h-7.5)/3) (applied 'for that part')", "extracted_value": null, "extracted_operator": "formula"}, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "REFERRAL_TO_LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "effective_from": "2026-09-29", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "GOLD_COAST"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "CGC:HIGH_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}], "subjects": ["ANY"], "sources": [{"key": "gc_hdr_side_rear_setback_height_tiered", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"side_and_rear_setback_min\", \"operator\": \"formula\", \"value\": null, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"height up to 4.5m: 1.5m\", \"for that part between 4.5m - 7.5m: 2m\", \"for that part exceeding 7.5m: an extra 0.5m is added for every 3m in height or part thereof over 7.5m\"], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": \"h<=4.5 -> 1.5; 4.5<h<=7.5 -> 2.0; h>7.5 -> 2.0 + 0.5*ceil((h-7.5)/3) (applied 'for that part')\"}\nLot conditions (not encoded): Standard (non-small-lot) table\nStructure scope 'all buildings (no Class 10 / outbuilding distinction, no built-to-boundary allowance in standard table)' mapped by keyword to ['ANY']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES\nResearcher notes: Wording is 'for that part between/exceeding' (per-part, stepped setback), as in MDR. Table 1.5-1 (s1.5, ruleId 2203, text unchanged in v14) lists 'Alternatives to QDC boundary clearance provisions' -> 'Buildings: Relevant zone code ...' (Section 33(2) BA). Applies to buildings (incl. Class 1 and Class 10a buildings such as sheds, garages, carports). For 'Structures' only the Coastal erosion hazard and Road widening overlay codes are alternatives; 'QDC setbacks will apply to any building or structure where an alternative setback is not provided in the above codes.' Scheme refers to QDC MP1.1/MP1.2, not the QHC."}$q$::jsonb);
