SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "CGC.gc_hdr_small_lot_side_setback", "instrument_version": "CGC_CITY_PLAN@2026-09-29", "topic": "SETBACK.SIDE", "title": "6.2.3.3 Table 6.2.3-1 RO1 (small lots); Table 6.2.3-2 AO1", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "BUILDING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTED_DEVELOPMENT_REQUIREMENT", "measurement": "SCHEME_SETBACK_SIDE", "operator": ">=", "value": {"op": "unencoded", "text": "wall/balcony: h<=4.5 -> 1.0; part 4.5-7.5 -> 1.5; part >7.5 -> 2.0. outermost projection: 0.5 / 1.0 / 1.5", "extracted_value": null, "extracted_operator": "formula"}, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "REFERRAL_TO_LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "effective_from": "2026-09-29", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "GOLD_COAST"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "CGC:HIGH_DENSITY_RESIDENTIAL"}], "subjects": ["CLASS_1"], "sources": [{"key": "gc_hdr_small_lot_side_setback", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"side_rear_setback_min_small_lot\", \"operator\": \"formula\", \"value\": null, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"up to 4.5m: 1m to wall and balcony; 0.5m to outermost projection\", \"for that part between 4.5m - 7.5m: 1.5m to wall and balcony; 1m to outermost projection\", \"for that part exceeding 7.5m: 2m to wall and balcony; 1.5m (RO1 reads '1.5 to outermost projection', AO1 '1.5m') to outermost projection\"], \"exceptions\": [\"not applicable to the secondary frontage of corner lots\", \"0m to class 10 building and/or non-habitable room in stated circumstances (gc_hdr_small_lot_class10_built_to_boundary)\"], \"formula_text\": \"wall/balcony: h<=4.5 -> 1.0; part 4.5-7.5 -> 1.5; part >7.5 -> 2.0. outermost projection: 0.5 / 1.0 / 1.5\"}\nLot conditions (not encoded): small lot (< 400m2)\nStructure scope 'Dwelling house on small lot (wall/balcony vs outermost projection)' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_1']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES\nResearcher notes: Same as LDR/MDR small-lot side/rear table. RO1 omits the unit in '1.5 to outermost projection' (AO1: '1.5m'). Table 1.5-1 (s1.5, ruleId 2203, text unchanged in v14) lists 'Alternatives to QDC boundary clearance provisions' -> 'Buildings: Relevant zone code ...' (Section 33(2) BA). Applies to buildings (incl. Class 1 and Class 10a buildings such as sheds, garages, carports). For 'Structures' only the Coastal erosion hazard and Road widening overlay codes are alternatives; 'QDC setbacks will apply to any building or structure where an alternative setback is not provided in the above codes.' Scheme refers to QDC MP1.1/MP1.2, not the QHC."}$q$::jsonb);
